      "exploreSections":["Sino-Korean 0-10 and place values","Native Korean 1-99","counter form changes 하나→한, 둘→두, 셋→세, 넷→네, 스물→스무","common counters","date system","time system","age","money and large numbers","mixed-system examples"],
      "practiceIdeas":["read a price","tell a time","convert a date","choose the correct counter","mixed Native/Sino time drill"]
