      "keyContrasts":["-(으)ㄹ 거예요 plan vs probability","-(으)ㄹ래요 preference/intention vs -(으)ㄹ까요? shared proposal/opinion","-(으)ㄹ게요 first-person promise vs -(으)ㄹ래요","conjectural -겠- (Lesson 12) vs intentional -겠- (Lesson 13)"],
